physicalRef: stop/database
description: "Logistics cargo theft Link Analysis showcase - Stop-level GPS from the carriers' telematics: one row per time a truck stood still on the road - the place, when the stop started and how many minutes it lasted. Not every ping; a carrier that sends no telematics has no rows. One file per month of departure (STOP_YYYYMM.csv); the next month is in data/staged. Landed by the stop Pipeline. Synthetic."
eventDate: start_at
columns[4]{name,type,classification}:
  trip_id,string,
  place_id,string,
  start_at,timestamp,
  minutes,number,
